        <h1>About Noble University</h1>

        <p><strong>Noble University</strong> is a private university located in <strong>Junagadh, Gujarat, India</strong>. Established in <strong>2007</strong>, it has received recognition from the <strong>University Grants Commission (UGC)</strong> and approvals from various regulatory bodies such as <strong>AICTE, PCI, and INC</strong>.</p>

        <h2>Programs Offered</h2>
        <p>The university offers a wide range of undergraduate, postgraduate, and doctoral programs in various disciplines, including:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Engineering Courses:</strong> B.Tech in Computer Science, Mechanical Engineering, Civil Engineering, and Electrical Engineering</li>
            <li><strong>Management Courses:</strong> MBA, BBA, and Integrated MBA</li>
            <li><strong>Pharmacy Courses:</strong> B.Pharm and M.Pharm</li>
            <li><strong>Nursing Courses:</strong> Nursing and Post Basic Nursing</li>
            <li><strong>Arts and Science Courses:</strong> B.A, and in various disciplines</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Research & Industry Collaboration</h2>
        <p>The university has a strong focus on <strong>research and innovation</strong>, with a dedicated <em>Research and Development Cell</em>. It also has collaborations with various industries and organizations to offer:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Internships</li>
            <li>Live Projects</li>
            <li>Campus Placements</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Campus & Facilities</h2>
        <p>The university offers modern infrastructure and student-friendly facilities:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Hostels for boys and girls</li>
            <li>Well-equipped libraries and laboratories</li>
            <li>Sports facilities</li>
            <li>Scholarship programs for meritorious students</li>
            <li>Strong alumni network</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="highlight">
            <p><strong>In conclusion:</strong> Noble University is a reputed institution with quality education, research opportunities, and strong industry ties that support holistic student growth.</p>
        </div>
